## Part 4: Token Consumption — Detailed Comparison

### Method A: Flat Markdown (Single Call)

```
TOKEN BREAKDOWN — FLAT MARKDOWN:
════════════════════════════════

CALL 1 (the only call):
  INPUT:
    System prompt:           200 tokens
    All specs (14 items):    514 tokens
    Instruction:              50 tokens
    ────────────────────────────────
    Total input:             764 tokens

  OUTPUT:
    All generated code:    3,760 tokens
    (all files concatenated in one response)

  CALL TOTAL:              4,524 tokens


GRAND TOTAL: 4,524 tokens
  Input:  764 tokens
  Output: 3,760 tokens
```

### Method B: Graph-Based (Multiple Calls)

```
