Linking                6,000 tokens      0 tokens    100%
Conflict detection     3,000 tokens    600 tokens     80%
Task grouping              0 tokens      0 tokens      —
Code generation       25,000 tokens 25,000 tokens      0%
─────────────────────   ──────────    ──────────     ────────
TOTAL                 41,000 tokens 27,600 tokens     33%

AT LARGE SCALE (500 specs):

                        PURE LLM       HYBRID          SAVINGS
─────────────────────   ───────────    ───────────     ────────
Atomization             20,000 tok     10,000 tok      50%
Placement               15,000 tok          0 tok     100%
Linking                 30,000 tok          0 tok     100%
Conflict detection      15,000 tok      3,000 tok      80%
Task grouping                0 tok          0 tok       —
Code generation        125,000 tok    125,000 tok       0%
─────────────────────   ───────────    ───────────     ────────
TOTAL                  205,000 tok    138,000 tok      33%

THE PATTERN:
  Code generation dominates total cost at all scales.
  Hybrid saves 33% on total tokens by eliminating LLM
  calls for placement, linking, and most conflict detection.

  The savings percentage increases slightly at scale
  because placement/linking costs grow linearly with n
  while code generation costs grow sub-linearly (tasks
  stay constant size).
